<h2>Sajarah</h2>
<ul>
<li>&lt;a href="8000%20SM"&gt;8000 SM&lt;/a&gt;: &lt;a href="Manungsa"&gt;Manungsa&lt;/a&gt; ras Australoid utawa ras Austrolomelanesia]] manggon ana ing guwa-guwa ing pagunungan &lt;a href="Meratus"&gt;Meratus&lt;/a&gt;. Fosilné ditemokna ing Guwa Babi sing ana ing Gunung Batu Buli, &lt;a href="Randu%2C%20Muara%20Uya%2C%20Tabalong"&gt;Désa Randu&lt;/a&gt;.</li>
<li>&lt;a href="2500%20SM"&gt;2500 SM&lt;/a&gt;: Migrasi bangsa Malayu Proto saka Yunan menyang pulo &lt;a href="Borneo"&gt;Borneo&lt;/a&gt; sing dadi mbah buyuté suku &lt;a href="Dayak"&gt;Dayak&lt;/a&gt; (rumpun Ot Danum).</li>
<li>&lt;a href="1500%20SM"&gt;1500 SM&lt;/a&gt;: Migrasi bangsa Malayu Deutero menyang pulo Borneo.</li>
<li>&lt;a href="400"&gt;400&lt;/a&gt;: Migrasi wong &lt;a href="Sumatera"&gt;Sumatera&lt;/a&gt; sing gawa basa &lt;a href="Malayu"&gt;Malayu&lt;/a&gt; kuna.</li>
<li>&lt;a href="520"&gt;520&lt;/a&gt;: Wiwité&lt;a href="Karajan%20Tanjungpuri"&gt;Karajan Tanjungpuri&lt;/a&gt; di &lt;a href="Tanjung%2C%20Tabalong"&gt;Tanjung&lt;/a&gt; sing miwiti wong Malayu kuna.</li>
<li>&lt;a href="600"&gt;600&lt;/a&gt;: &lt;a href="Suku%20Dayak%20Maanyan"&gt;Suku Dayak Maanyan&lt;/a&gt; pindhah menyang &lt;a href="Pulo%20Bangka"&gt;Pulo Bangka&lt;/a&gt;, sak banjuré menyang &lt;a href="Madagaskar"&gt;Madagaskar&lt;/a&gt;.</li>
<li>&lt;a href="1200"&gt;1200&lt;/a&gt;: Ampu Jatmika, wong sugih saka nagari &lt;a href="Keling"&gt;Keling&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="Tamil"&gt;Tamil&lt;/a&gt;) miwiti &lt;a href="karajan%20Nagara%20Dipa"&gt;karajan Nagara Dipa&lt;/a&gt;, sadurungé ana ing cedhak Kali Tapin, panggonan sing dewekné miwiti Candhi Laras.</li>
<li>&lt;a href="1200"&gt;1200&lt;/a&gt;: Wong Tabalong sing nganggo &lt;a href="basa%20Malayu%20Bukit"&gt;basa Malayu Bukit&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="basa%20Maanyan"&gt;basa Maanyan&lt;/a&gt; manggoni Tabalong, salah siji saka lima laladan ilèn sungai (&lt;a href="Banua%20Lima"&gt;Banua Lima&lt;/a&gt;) sing ditakluké karo prajurit Ampu Jatmika saka Karajan Nagara Dipa sing ana ing Candhi Agung, &lt;a href="Amuntai"&gt;Amuntai&lt;/a&gt;.</li>
<li>&lt;a href="1362"&gt;1362&lt;/a&gt;: &lt;a href="Karajan%20Nan%20Sarunai"&gt;Karajan Nan Sarunai&lt;/a&gt;, karajan Suku Dayak Maanyan éntuk serangan saka Majapahit.</li>
<li>&lt;a href="1363"&gt;1363&lt;/a&gt;: Wewengkon &lt;a href="Barito"&gt;Barito&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Tabalong"&gt;Tabalong&lt;/a&gt; dan &lt;a href="pulau%20Sebuku"&gt;Sawuku&lt;/a&gt; dadi laladan taklukan &lt;a href="Karajan%20Majapahit"&gt;Karajan Majapahit&lt;/a&gt;. Pangeran Suryanata saka &lt;a href="Majapahit"&gt;Majapahit&lt;/a&gt; kasil dadi ratu Nagara Dipa.</li>
<li>&lt;a href="1400"&gt;1400&lt;/a&gt;: Wewengkon Tabalong lumebu ana ing wewengkon &lt;a href="Karajan%20Nagara%20Daha"&gt;Karajan Nagara Daha&lt;/a&gt;, sing neruské wangsa Nagara Dipa.</li>
<li>&lt;a href="1526"&gt;1526&lt;/a&gt;: Wewengkon Tabalong lumebu ana ing wewengkon Banua Lima, sawijining provinsi saka &lt;a href="Kesultanan%20Banjar"&gt;Kesultanan Banjar&lt;/a&gt;.</li>
<li>&lt;a href="17%20Agustus"&gt;17 Agustus&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1860"&gt;1860&lt;/a&gt;: &lt;a href="Pangeran"&gt;Pangeran&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Antasari"&gt;Antasari&lt;/a&gt; miwiti Benteng Tabalong.</li>
<li>&lt;a href="1899"&gt;1899&lt;/a&gt;: &lt;a href="Residen"&gt;Residen&lt;/a&gt; C.A Kroesen mimpin Zuider en Ooster Afdeeling van Borneo.</li>
<li>&lt;a href="1900"&gt;1900&lt;/a&gt;: Onderafdeeling Tabalong lan Kelua, pimpinane Controleur Klas I &lt;a href="C.H.%20Hall"&gt;C.H. Hall&lt;/a&gt;. Kepala Wewengkon Tabalong yaiku &lt;a href="Kiai%20Mohammad%20Seman"&gt;Kiai Mohammad Seman&lt;/a&gt; lan Kepala Wewengkon Kelua yaiku &lt;a href="Kiai%20Tjakra%20Widana"&gt;Kiai Tjakra Widana&lt;/a&gt;</li>
<li>&lt;a href="1938"&gt;1938&lt;/a&gt;: &lt;a href="Wester%20afdeeling%20van%20Borneo"&gt;Wester afdeeling van Borneo&lt;/a&gt;, Zuider en Ooster &lt;a href="Afdeeling"&gt;Afdeeling&lt;/a&gt; van Borneo dadi sawijining provinsi ing &lt;a href="Indhiya%20N%C3%A8derlan"&gt;Indhiya Nèderlan&lt;/a&gt;.</li>
<li>&lt;a href="1927"&gt;1927&lt;/a&gt;: Pambrontakan &lt;a href="Gusti%20Barmawi"&gt;Gusti Barmawi&lt;/a&gt; tumuju soal rodi.</li>
<li>&lt;a href="1937"&gt;1937&lt;/a&gt;: Pambrontakan Hariang, &lt;a href="Banua%20Lawas%2C%20Tabalong"&gt;Banua Lawas, Tabalong&lt;/a&gt; ndadèké matiné &lt;a href="kepala%20wewengkon"&gt;kepala wewengkon&lt;/a&gt; yaiku &lt;a href="Kiai"&gt;Kiai&lt;/a&gt; Masdulhak.</li>
<li>&lt;a href="6"&gt;6&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="F%C3%A8bruari"&gt;Fèbruari&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1942"&gt;1942&lt;/a&gt;: &lt;a href="Jepang"&gt;Jepang&lt;/a&gt; manggoni kutha &lt;a href="Tanjung%2C%20Tabalong"&gt;Tanjung&lt;/a&gt;.</li>
<li>&lt;a href="18%20Maret"&gt;18 Maret&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1942"&gt;1942&lt;/a&gt;: &lt;a href="Kiai"&gt;Kiai&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Pangeran%20Musa%20Ardi%20Kesuma"&gt;Pangeran Musa Ardi Kesuma&lt;/a&gt; dikongkon Jepang dadi Ridzie, penguasa sing paling kuwasa lang paling dhuwur pamrintah sipil sak sajeroning wewengkon Banjarmasin, Hulu Sungai, Kapuas lan Barito.</li>
<li>&lt;a href="18%20Agustus"&gt;18 Agustus&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1945"&gt;1945&lt;/a&gt;: Papréntahan &lt;a href="Sukarno"&gt;Sukarno&lt;/a&gt;-&lt;a href="Hatta"&gt;Hatta&lt;/a&gt; ngongkon Ir. H. &lt;a href="Pangeran%20Muhammad%20Noor"&gt;Pangeran Muhammad Noor&lt;/a&gt; dadi gubernur &lt;a href="Kalimantan"&gt;Kalimantan&lt;/a&gt;</li>
<li>&lt;a href="3%20Juni"&gt;3 Juni&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1949"&gt;1949&lt;/a&gt;: Paperangan Serangan Umum Kutha &lt;a href="Tanjung%2C%20Tabalong"&gt;Tanjung&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Tabalong"&gt;Tabalong&lt;/a&gt;.</li>
