Robert Hooke

Robert Hooke, &lt;a href="Fellow%20of%20the%20Royal%20Society"&gt;FRS&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="18%20Juli"&gt;18 Juli&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1635"&gt;1635&lt;/a&gt;-&lt;a href="3%20Maret"&gt;3 Maret&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1703"&gt;1703&lt;/a&gt;) iku èlmuwan &lt;a href="polymath"&gt;polymath&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Inggris"&gt;Inggris&lt;/a&gt; kang mainaké peran wigati sajeroning &lt;a href="r%C3%A9volusi%20ilmiah"&gt;révolusi ilmiah&lt;/a&gt;, liwat makarya eksperimen lan teoretis.
