</ul>

</doc>
<doc id="53401" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=53401" title="Kebon Botani Albury">
Kebon Botani Albury

Kebon Botani Albury iku sawijining &lt;a href="kebon%20botani"&gt;kebon botani&lt;/a&gt; sing manggon ing &lt;a href="kutha"&gt;kutha&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Albury%2C%20New%20South%20Wales"&gt;Albury&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="New%20South%20Wales"&gt;New South Wales&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Australia"&gt;Australia&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;a href="Kebon%20botani"&gt;Kebon botani&lt;/a&gt; iki diwiwiti saka taun &lt;a href="1877"&gt;1877&lt;/a&gt; lan minangka &lt;a href="kebon%20botani"&gt;kebon botani&lt;/a&gt; percontohan ing wiwitan abad angka &lt;a href="1800"&gt;19&lt;/a&gt; lan angka &lt;a href="1900"&gt;20&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;a href="Kebon%20botani"&gt;Kebon botani&lt;/a&gt; iki duwé jembar 4 hèktar lan duwé spesialisasi marang &lt;a href="tuwuhan"&gt;tuwuhan&lt;/a&gt; spésies &lt;a href="alas%20tropis"&gt;alas tropis&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Australia"&gt;Australia&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;a href="Kebon%20botani"&gt;Kebon botani&lt;/a&gt; iki saiki dirumat déning &lt;a href="pamar%C3%A9ntah"&gt;pamaréntah&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="kutha"&gt;kutha&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Albury%2C%20New%20South%20Wales"&gt;Albury&lt;/a&gt; lan kabèh éntuk lumebu tanpa mbayar.
