<doc id="53405" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=53405" title="Kebon Botani Tropenburg">
Kebon Botani Tropenburg

Kebon Botani Trompenburg iku sawijining &lt;a href="kebon%20botani"&gt;kebon botani&lt;/a&gt; sing manggon ing kutha &lt;a href="Rotterdam"&gt;Rotterdam&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Walanda"&gt;Walanda&lt;/a&gt;, sing isiné &lt;a href="tuwuhan"&gt;tuwuhan&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="woody"&gt;woody&lt;/a&gt; lan uga tuwuhan &lt;a href="herbaceous"&gt;herbaceous&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;a href="Kebon%20botani"&gt;Kebon botani&lt;/a&gt; iki jembaré 7 hektar lan manggon pas 4 mèter sak ngisoré lumahing sagara, saéngga sawijining sistim kanal dipatrapna kanggo nggaringaké areané. &lt;a href="Kebun%20botani"&gt;Kebun botani&lt;/a&gt; iki diwiwiti ing abad angka &lt;a href="1800"&gt;19&lt;/a&gt;, lan wiwit taun &lt;a href="1958"&gt;1958&lt;/a&gt; dibukak kanggo sapa waé kanthi bayar sethithik. &lt;a href="Kebon%20botani"&gt;Kebon botani&lt;/a&gt; iki uga duwé sawatara jinis tuwuhan nasional nagari &lt;a href="Walanda"&gt;Walanda&lt;/a&gt;, kaya ta &lt;a href="Conifers"&gt;Conifers&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Quercus"&gt;Quercus&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Fagus"&gt;Fagus&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Rhododendron"&gt;Rhododendron&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Ligustrum"&gt;Ligustrum&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Rodgersia"&gt;Rodgersia&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Hosta"&gt;Hosta&lt;/a&gt;.
